# 统一换行：仓库内存 LF，检出时按平台转换，避免 CRLF/LF 反复互相覆盖
* text=auto

*.cs        text diff=csharp
*.xaml      text
*.csproj    text
*.slnx      text
*.json      text
*.md        text
*.ps1       text
*.gitignore text
*.gitattributes text

# 二进制：不要做任何换行/编码转换
*.exe       binary
*.dll       binary
*.png       binary
*.ico       binary
